  "html": "<p>At <strong>Highway 90 Dispensary</strong>, we know that 4/20 is more than just a day – it’s a season to celebrate the vibrant community we’re all a part of. It’s about honoring the people shaping a cannabis culture that’s inclusive and enjoyable for everyone.</p><p>This is a shoutout to our local artists, musicians, creators, parents, students, and dispensary staff who are all contributing to the good life and supporting our communities.</p><p>We’re thrilled to invite you to join us this <strong>Friday, April 11th</strong> for our stop on the <strong>Fern:20 Tour</strong> right here at <strong>Highway 90 Dispensary</strong> in Marlton, New Jersey!</p><p><strong>Ready for the tour?</strong> Head over to Highway 90 before April 11th and receive a <strong>coupon for 20% off your next Fernway purchase</strong>. <a href=\"/brands/fernway/\">Shop now</a> and don’t miss out!</p><p>Learn more about the Fern:20 tour <a href=\"https://fernway.com/fern20/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here.</a></p><p>The <strong>Fern:20 tour</strong> is hitting dispensaries all over New Jersey, New York, and Massachusetts, celebrating the 4/20 season, local communities, and cannabis culture wherever they go.</p><p><strong>What’s in store for you?</strong></p><ul><li><strong>In-Store Promotion:</strong> Get <strong>Buy One, Get One 42% OFF</strong> all Fernway products on Friday, April 11th, all day long!</li><li><strong>Exclusive Tour Merch:</strong> Grab some <strong>limited edition Fern:20 t-shirts</strong> and <strong>green metallic stylus</strong> merchandise exclusive to the tour.*</li><li><strong>Food and Live Music:</strong> Enjoy live tunes by <strong>The Eli &amp; Lou Duo</strong>, followed by delicious bites from the <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/notyouraverageweinertruck?igsh=MWlzZmgzeHlsbDh4dQ==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Not Your Average Weiner</strong> </a>food truck.</li></ul><p>Don’t miss out on this amazing celebration of 4/20 season, community, and cannabis culture! We can’t wait to see you at Highway 90!<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/notyouraverageweinertruck?igsh=MWlzZmgzeHlsbDh4dQ==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/notyouravergaeweinerlogo-1.jpg\" alt=\"Not your average weiner got dog food truck in marlton new jersey\"><br>\n</a></p><p>*Conditions apply. While supplies last.</p>",
